## Consulting

I am open to paid consulting engagements in the following areas:

- **Research**, including scientific advisory and project support.
- **Development**, covering both software engineering and the application of AI in real-world processes.
- **Teaching activities**, such as courses, seminars, and training sessions.

## Collaborations

- **Scientific collaborations** (e.g., joint research, publications) are welcome and offered **free of charge**.
- Collaborations **aimed at commercial products or patents** are evaluated on a case-by-case basis; terms and details are to be **discussed directly**.

